WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A ringed planet fills the horizon.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
A ship above a lamplit workshop in the blue evening.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
The ship rests beside the workshop.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
A slow departure toward the stars.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
A brass orbital instrument turns in gold light.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Return to the planet. The machines can think. You still decide.
